# Copy to `.env.local`, which is gitignored. Next.js reads `.env.local`
# automatically; `drizzle.config.ts` and the migration runner read it explicitly
# because they are separate processes.
#
# One variable, because one variable is all anything reads today. The full list
# and real boot-time validation — so a missing or malformed value fails at start
# rather than on the first query — are #20.

# Local Postgres from docker-compose.yml. `npm run db:up` starts it. These
# credentials are the committed dev ones: the database holds no real data and is
# published to loopback only. Never reuse the password anywhere reachable off
# the machine.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://capexwise:capexwise_local_dev@127.0.0.1:5432/capexwise
